.Dd October 16, 2026
.Dt LCC 1
.Os 1.6.2

.Sh NAME
.Nm lcc
.Nd Lumina Control Center, a launcher for the Lumina configuration utilities.

.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | -help
.Op Fl v | -version

.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
opens the Lumina Control Center, a single window that lists every
Lumina Control Center (LCC) configuration utility together with any other
installed application whose desktop entry is in the
.Qq Settings
category.
Entries are grouped into Appearance, Interface, Session, User and System
categories and can be filtered with the search field.
Activating an entry launches the corresponding utility.
.Pp
Each utility is also a standalone program and can be run directly:
.Bl -tag -width "lcc-window-manager" -offset indent
.It Xr lcc-wallpaper 1
Desktop background images.
.It Xr lcc-compositor 1
Window effects and compositing.
.It Xr lcc-window-manager 1
Window manager theme and behavior.
.It Xr lcc-desktop 1
Desktop plugins and icons.
.It Xr lcc-panels 1
Desktop panels and panel plugins.
.It Xr lcc-menu 1
Desktop context menu.
.It Xr lcc-autostart 1
Applications started at login.
.It Xr lcc-defaultapps 1
Default applications and file associations.
.It Xr lcc-keyboard 1
Keyboard shortcuts.
.It Xr lcc-sound-theme 1
Session sound events.
.It Xr lcc-session 1
General session options.
.It Xr lcc-locale 1
Session locale.
.It Xr lcc-mouse 1
Mouse and pointer settings.
.It Xr lcc-bluetooth 1
Bluetooth devices.
.El

.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Display help on command line options.
.It Fl v , Fl -version
Display version information.
.El
.Pp
Only one instance of
.Nm
runs at a time; starting it again raises the existing window.

.Sh KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.Bl -tag -width "Ctrl+F" -offset indent
.It Ic Ctrl+F
Focus the search field.
.El

.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/bin/lcc
.It Pa /usr/local/share/applications/*.desktop
Scanned for additional Settings applications, along with
.Pa /usr/share/applications
and
.Pa ~/.local/share/applications .
.El

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lumina-config 1 ,
.Xr lumina-desktop 1

